WEBVTT

00:11:01.156 --> 00:11:03.158
Like them, I am far from perfect.

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:08.330
Despite my mistakes,

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:11.834
my greatest achievement
is being Clayton and SaMya's father.

00:11:13.752 --> 00:11:18.632
(Applause)

00:11:19.383 --> 00:11:23.470
Millions of fathers today,

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:26.432
regardless of their location,

00:11:26.473 --> 00:11:28.142
can say the same thing.